# .trivyignore - Hardened branch accepted risk suppressions
#
# The three intentional IaC vulnerabilities from REMEDIATION.md
# (S3 public access, open security group, unencrypted EBS) are ALL fixed
# in terraform/main.tf on this branch.
#
# The rules below are suppressed as out-of-scope for this single-resource
# demo module. They would be addressed in a production module.

# S3 access logging - requires a separate logging bucket; out of scope
# for this demo. In production: aws_s3_bucket_logging resource added.
AVD-AWS-0089

# S3 versioning - not required for a demo compute bucket with no
# long-lived objects. In production: aws_s3_bucket_versioning enabled.
AVD-AWS-0088
